            0.307
          ],
          "content": "(c) the third fountain will fill the cistern is $1 \\div   { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } }   =$ **Ans:** 4 times"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.325,
            0.742,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "(d) the fourth fountain will fill the cistern is $1 \\div   { \\frac { 1 } { 5 } }   =$"
