        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.396,
            0.881,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": "**The number of times the four fountains together will fill the cistern in** a day is ${ \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { + } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { + } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { + } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { + } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { + } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { - } { \\bf \\underline { { \\quad } } } ^ { - } = 1 2 .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.435,
            0.881,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** The number of times the four fountains together will fill the cistern in a day is = 1 + 2 + 4 + 5 = 12"
